  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 34.53,
      "e": 37.12,
      "text": "<b>As a firefighter, it's what you do.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.66,
      "e": 42.08,
      "text": "<b>You put your lives on the line for people because it's something bigger than you.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.04,
      "e": 44.46,
      "text": "<b>You want to be there for your community, you</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.46,
      "e": 46.17,
      "text": "<b>want to be there for people to help them in any way.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.3,
      "e": 51.63,
      "text": "<b>You can't have fear going in on any call, and</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.63,
      "e": 53.8,
      "text": "<b>that's just something you do as a firefighter.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.8,
      "e": 57.35,
      "text": "<b>You put fear and emotion aside and you think for the better of people.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.85,
      "e": 69.11,
      "text": "<b>I'd like to thank the WSTF Fire Department for this very, very incredible</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.11,
      "e": 72.57,
      "text": "<b>memorial that they gave to the 9/11 events.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.45,
      "e": 78.16,
      "text": "<b>Years ago, I was actually at the 9-11 Memorial in New York.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.16,
      "e": 82.37,
      "text": "<b>It's one of the most moving things I've ever seen, witnessed in my life.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.37,
      "e": 86.38,
      "text": "<b>And to have the White Sands Fire Department become part of this memorial and to the</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.38,
      "e": 90.76,
      "text": "<b>firefighters and first responders who lost their life in that event,</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.76,
      "e": 91.8,
      "text": "<b>it's an incredible honor.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 92.26,
      "e": 95.55,
      "text": "<b>And thank you so much for representing White Sands and doing this.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.8,
      "e": 96.89,
      "text": "<b>This is incredible.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.89,
      "e": 99.72,
      "text": "<b>For Jimmy, Deputy Chief Herrera.</b>"
    },
    {
      "s": 100.18,
